ir descriptions in English and French. To which are added observations on the air, soil, and waters: with remarks upon agriculture, grain, pulse, roots, &c. To the whole, is prefixed a new and correct map of the countries treated of / By Mark Catesby ... Histoire naturelle de la Caroline, la Floride, & les Isles Bahama: contenant les desseins des oiseaux, animaux, poissons, serpents, insectes, & plantes. Et en particulier, des arbres des forets, arbrisseaux, & autres plantes, qui n'ont point été decrits, jusques à present par les auteurs, ou peu exactement dessinés. Avec leur descriptions en françois & en anglois. A quoi on a adjouté, des observations sur l'air, le sol, & les eaux, avec des remarques sur l'agriculture, les grains, les legumes, les racines, &c. Le tout est precedé d'une carte nouvelle & exacte des païs dont il s'agist.","Artist":"Mark Catesby","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/qzmyqb6d/images?id=cvrs4tjp","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/L0021241/full/!1000,1000/0/default.jpg","ObjectID":6545},{"Title":"The Roman aqueduct at Segovia. Engraving.","Artist":"","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/r7zu74bt/images?id=cjtr9mdh","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/V0020176/full/!1000,1000/0/default.jpg","ObjectID":6656},{"Title":"Men, women and children are performing a variety of physical exercises. Photolithograph, 1888.","Artist":"","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/rfmhfm5r/images?id=b27eeb8h","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/V0040472ER/full/!1000,1000/0/default.jpg","ObjectID":6767},{"Title":"Textiles: a mechanical Jacquard loom, three-quarter view with spectators. Engraving.","Artist":"","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Coll